{
    "title": "Athlete 2 Lite: Watch face",
    "description": "<b>Only for Wear OS devices - API 28+</b>\r\n<i>// not suitable for rectangular watches</i>\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#897eff\"><i>Powered by <b>Watch Face Format</b></i></font>\r\n\r\n<big><b><a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Famoledwatchfaces.com&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw351EA2hKuGQCFOrAwqOZ-4\">amoledwatchfaces.com</a></b></big>\r\n\r\n<big><b><font color=\"#fd5f00\">ATHLETE 2 PRO VERSION</font></b></big>\r\n<b>play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.amoledwatchfaces.athlete2</b>\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#fd5f00\">ADDITIONAL COMPLICATION APPS</font></b>\r\nHeart Rate: <b>bit.ly/3OTRPCH</b>\r\nDistance, Calories, Floors: <b>bit.ly/3OULtDb</b>\r\nComplications Suite: <b>bit.ly/3yuRwr1</b>\r\nPhone Battery: <b>bit.ly/3c31hoz</b>\r\n\r\n<big><b><font color=\"#00a675\">FEATURES</font></b></big>\r\n\u2022 sharp & high-res graphics\r\n\u2022 lite version\r\n\u2022 gradient progress bars with dynamic texts\r\n\u2022 PNGQuant optimized layers > battery friendly\r\n\u2022 unique ambient mode with low OPR, adaptive colors & styles\r\n\u2022 5x custom complication\r\n\r\n<big><b><font color=\"#00a675\">CUSTOMIZATION</font></b></big>\r\n\u2022 long press Watch face center > open customization settings\r\n\t  1. Steps Bar (10x) (+2 on API 33+)\r\n\t  2. Battery Bar (10x) (+2 on API 33+)\r\n\t  3. AOD Style (4x)\r\n\t  4. Color (Default + 29x)\r\n\t  5. Custom complications \r\n\t  \r\nInstallation and troubleshooting guide:\r\n<b>amoledwatchfaces.com/guide</b>\r\n\r\nPhone app serves only as a placeholder to make it easier to install & find the Watch face on your Wear OS watch. You have to select your watch device from the <b>install</b> drop-down menu\r\n\r\nPlease send any issues reports or help requests to our support address\r\n<b>support@amoledwatchfaces.com</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Join our Telegram group for live support and discussion</b>\r\n<b>t.me/amoledwatchfaces</b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Only for Wear OS devices - API 28+</b><br><i>// not suitable for rectangular watches</i><br><br><font color=\"#897eff\"><i>Powered by <b>Watch Face Format</b></i></font><br><br><big><b><a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Famoledwatchfaces.com&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AOvVaw351EA2hKuGQCFOrAwqOZ-4\">amoledwatchfaces.com</a></b></big><br><br><big><b><font color=\"#fd5f00\">ATHLETE 2 PRO VERSION</font></b></big><br><b>play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.amoledwatchfaces.athlete2</b><br><br><b><font color=\"#fd5f00\">ADDITIONAL COMPLICATION APPS</font></b><br>Heart Rate: <b>bit.ly/3OTRPCH</b><br>Distance, Calories, Floors: <b>bit.ly/3OULtDb</b><br>Complications Suite: <b>bit.ly/3yuRwr1</b><br>Phone Battery: <b>bit.ly/3c31hoz</b><br><br><big><b><font color=\"#00a675\">FEATURES</font></b></big><br>\u2022 sharp &amp; high-res graphics<br>\u2022 lite version<br>\u2022 gradient progress bars with dynamic texts<br>\u2022 PNGQuant optimized layers &gt; battery friendly<br>\u2022 unique ambient mode with low OPR, adaptive colors &amp; styles<br>\u2022 5x custom complication<br><br><big><b><font color=\"#00a675\">CUSTOMIZATION</font></b></big><br>\u2022 long press Watch face center &gt; open customization settings<br>\t  1. Steps Bar (10x) (+2 on API 33+)<br>\t  2. Battery Bar (10x) (+2 on API 33+)<br>\t  3. AOD Style (4x)<br>\t  4. Color (Default + 29x)<br>\t  5. Custom complications <br>\t  <br>Installation and troubleshooting guide:<br><b>amoledwatchfaces.com/guide</b><br><br>Phone app serves only as a placeholder to make it easier to install &amp; find the Watch face on your Wear OS watch. You have to select your watch device from the <b>install</b> drop-down menu<br><br>Please send any issues reports or help requests to our support address<br><b>support@amoledwatchfaces.com</b><br><br><b>Join our Telegram group for live support and discussion</b><br><b>t.me/amoledwatchfaces</b>",
